    <summary>Do you offer emergency plumbing in Houston?</summary>
    <p>Yes. We prioritize urgent calls (active leaks, sewer backups, and no hot water) and schedule as quickly as routes allow. For emergencies, call {{ site.phoneDisplay }} so we can dispatch the nearest technician.</p>
